#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Available repairs: %s"
msgstr "Àwọn àtúnṣe tí ó wà: %s"

#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Unknown format %s. Use text, json, nagios, or prometheus."
msgstr "Ìṣètò %s tí a kò mọ̀. Lo text, json, nagios, tàbí prometheus."

#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Redaction could not complete, so %s was not written."
msgstr "Ìṣàtúnkọ ìpamọ́ kò lè parí, nítorí náà a kò kọ %s."

#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Wrote %s. Review it before sharing; values after password, secret, token, and community names are masked."
msgstr "A ti kọ %s. Ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ̀ kí o tó pín in; a ti bo àwọn ìní lẹ́yìn ọ̀rọ̀-ìpamọ́, àṣírí, tọ́kìnì, àti àwọn orúkọ àwùjọ mọ́lẹ̀."

#: cli/doctor.php doctor_functions.php
msgid "Unknown repair"
msgstr "Àtúnṣe tí a kò mọ̀"

#: cli/doctor.php
msgid "Refusing to repair without --yes."
msgstr "Ń kọ̀ láti ṣàtúnṣe láìsí --yes."

#: cli/doctor.php
msgid "Select a supported symptom and text or JSON output."
msgstr "Yan àmì àìsàn tí a ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn fún àti àbájáde text tàbí JSON."

#: cli/doctor.php doctor_web.php
msgid "Accepted warning"
msgstr "Ìkìlọ̀ tí a gbà"

#: doctor_access.php doctor_functions.php
msgid "Device availability"
msgstr "Wíwà lárọ̀ọ́wọ́tó ẹ̀rọ"

#: doctor_access.php
msgid "Device permissions could not be evaluated."
msgstr "A kò lè ṣe ìṣirò àwọn àṣẹ ẹ̀rọ."

#: doctor_access.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI cannot run Doctor checks."
msgstr "PHP CLI tí a ṣètò kò lè ṣe àwọn àyẹ̀wò Doctor."

#: doctor_access.php
msgid "Doctor checks failed or exceeded their time limit. Review the Doctor log."
msgstr "Àwọn àyẹ̀wò Doctor kùnà tàbí wọ́n kọjá ààlà àkókò wọn. Ṣàyẹ̀wò àkọọ́lẹ̀ ìṣẹ̀lẹ̀ Doctor."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Graphs stopped updating"
msgstr "Àwọn gíráàfù ti dá ìsọdọ̀tun dúró"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Polling is slow"
msgstr "Ìwádìí (polling) ń lọ lọ́ra"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Devices are missing or unavailable"
msgstr "Àwọn ẹ̀rọ sọnù tàbí wọn kò sí ní àrọ́wọ́tó"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Doctor alerts are missing"
msgstr "Àwọn ìkìlọ̀ Doctor kò sí"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Check the poller scheduler and the affected poller log, then verify a new completed cycle."
msgstr "Ṣàyẹ̀wò olùṣètò ìkójọ àti àkọsílẹ̀ olùkójọ tó kan, lẹ́yìn náà rí i dájú pé àyíká tuntun kan ti parí."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collection may have stopped."
msgstr "Ìkójọ lè ti dáwọ́ dúró."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collected values may not be reaching disk."
msgstr "Àwọn iye tí a kójọ lè má dé orí díískì."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Inspect the output queue and Boost flush history; verify that the queue drains and RRD timestamps advance."
msgstr "Ṣàyẹ̀wò ìlà àbájáde àti ìtàn ìfọ̀mọ́ Boost; rí i dájú pé ìlà náà ń ṣàn kúrò àti pé àwọn àkókò RRD ń tẹ̀síwájú."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Check storage capacity, runtime-directory permissions and the last RRD update; account for deferred writes."
msgstr "Ṣàyẹ̀wò agbára ìpamọ́, àṣẹ àpò-ìwé ìṣiṣẹ́ àti ìmúdójúìwọ̀n RRD tó kẹ́yìn; ṣàkọsílẹ̀ àwọn ìkọ̀wé tí a sún síwájú."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "RRD storage needs investigation."
msgstr "Ìpamọ́ RRD nílò ìwádìí."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collection work may be exceeding its time budget."
msgstr "Iṣẹ́ ìkójọ lè ń kọjá ààlà àkókò rẹ̀."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Compare cycle duration with the polling interval and inspect device timeouts before increasing concurrency."
msgstr "Fi gígùn àyíká wé àkókò ìkójọ kí o sì ṣàyẹ̀wò àkókò ìdádúró ẹ̀rọ kí o tó pọ̀ sí iṣẹ́ àjọṣepọ̀."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Compare database counters during a slow cycle and inspect query plans before changing server limits."
msgstr "Fi àwọn òǹkà ibùdó dátà wé ní àkókò àyíká tó lọ́ra kí o sì ṣàyẹ̀wò ètò ìbéèrè kí o tó yí ààlà olùpèsè padà."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Database pressure may be contributing to slow polling."
msgstr "Ìfúngún ibùdó dátà lè ń ṣàfikún sí ìkójọ tó lọ́ra."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collection prerequisites or reachability may be failing."
msgstr "Àwọn ohun ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ ìkójọ tàbí ìbáṣepọ̀ lè ń kùnà."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Verify the affected device permissions, reachability, credentials and assigned poller using Cacti diagnostics."
msgstr "Rí i dájú àwọn àṣẹ ẹ̀rọ tó kan, ìbáṣepọ̀, ìwé-ẹ̀rí àti olùkójọ tí a yàn nípa lílo àyẹ̀wò Cacti."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Scheduled checks or mail delivery need attention."
msgstr "Àwọn àyẹ̀wò tí a ṣètò tàbí ìfiranṣẹ́ í-meèlì nílò àkíyèsí."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Verify scheduling and recipient settings, inspect retained delivery attempts, and send a Cacti test email."
msgstr "Rí i dájú ètò àkókò àti àwọn olùgbà, ṣàyẹ̀wò àwọn ìgbìyànjú ìfiranṣẹ́ tó kù, kí o sì fi í-meèlì àyẹ̀wò Cacti ránṣẹ́."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Possible causes require verification; matching checks do not establish a root cause."
msgstr "Àwọn ohun tó ṣeé ṣe kí ó fà á nílò ìdánilójú; àwọn àyẹ̀wò tó báramu kò fi ìdí gbòngbò ìṣòro múlẹ̀."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "No cause is established by the available observations. Run fresh diagnostics and investigate the symptom directly."
msgstr "Kò sí ìdí kankan tí àwọn àkíyèsí tó wà fi múlẹ̀. Ṣe àyẹ̀wò tuntun kí o sì ṣèwádìí àmì àìsàn náà tààrà."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "At least 24 hours since server startup and FLUSH STATUS. Counters are cumulative and may have different reset histories; confirm trends during a representative workload before tuning."
msgstr "Ó kéré tán wákàtí 24 láti ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ olùpèsè àti FLUSH STATUS. Àwọn òǹkà jẹ́ àkópọ̀, wọ́n sì lè ní ìtàn ìtúnṣe tó yàtọ̀; rí ìtọ́sọ́nà dájú ní àkókò iṣẹ́ aṣojú kí o tó ṣàtúnṣe."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Cumulative tuning advice is deferred: obtain valid uptime and at least 24 hours since startup and FLUSH STATUS. Missing metrics or an inconsistent sample cannot establish database health."
msgstr "Ìmọ̀ràn àtúnṣe àkópọ̀ ti sún síwájú: gba àkókò ìṣiṣẹ́ tó péye àti ó kéré tán wákàtí 24 láti ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ àti FLUSH STATUS. Àwọn ìwọ̀n tó sọnù tàbí àpẹẹrẹ tí kò báramu kò lè fi ìlera ibùdó dátà múlẹ̀."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database observation window"
msgstr "Àkókò àkíyèsí ibùdó dátà"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Connection metrics are unavailable or invalid. Check access to SHOW GLOBAL STATUS and SHOW GLOBAL VARIABLES; do not treat missing metrics as an idle server."
msgstr "Àwọn ìwọ̀n ìsopọ̀ kò sí tàbí kò tọ́. Ṣàyẹ̀wò ìwọ̀lé sí SHOW GLOBAL STATUS àti SHOW GLOBAL VARIABLES; má ṣe ka àwọn ìwọ̀n tó sọnù sí olùpèsè tí kò ṣiṣẹ́."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Current connections: %.0f / %.0f (%s); recorded peak: %.0f (%s of the current limit)."
msgstr "Àwọn ìsopọ̀ lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́: %.0f / %.0f (%s); òkè tó ga jù lọ tí a kọ sílẹ̀: %.0f (%s ti ààlà lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́)."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review connection pooling and poller concurrency. Check database-host memory headroom before raising max_connections; the historical peak may reflect an older limit."
msgstr "Ṣàtúnyẹ̀wò ìkójọpọ̀ ìsopọ̀ àti iṣẹ́ àjọṣepọ̀ olùkójọ. Ṣàyẹ̀wò ààyè ìrántí olùgbàlejò ibùdó dátà kí o tó gbé max_connections sókè; òkè ìtàn lè ṣàfihàn ààlà àtijọ́."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Connection capacity"
msgstr "Agbára ìsopọ̀"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "InnoDB buffer pool reads"
msgstr "Ìka adágún ààbò InnoDB"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review query plans and the working set. Consider innodb_buffer_pool_size only after measuring memory available on the database host; a cumulative miss ratio alone does not prove memory pressure."
msgstr "Ṣàtúnyẹ̀wò àwọn ètò ìbéèrè àti àkójọ iṣẹ́. Ronú nípa innodb_buffer_pool_size lẹ́yìn tí o bá ti wọ̀n ìrántí tó wà lórí olùgbàlejò ibùdó dátà nìkan; ìpín àṣìṣe àkópọ̀ nìkan kò fi ìfúngún ìrántí hàn."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "On-disk temporary tables"
msgstr "Àwọn tábìlì ìgbà díẹ̀ orí díískì"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review query plans, sorting, grouping, and temporary-table data types before changing memory limits. Some tables must use disk; memory limits and accounting differ between MySQL and MariaDB versions."
msgstr "Ṣàtúnyẹ̀wò àwọn ètò ìbéèrè, ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ, ìpínsí àwọn ẹgbẹ́, àti irú dátà tábìlì ìgbà díẹ̀ kí o tó yí ààlà ìrántí padà. Àwọn tábìlì kan gbọ́dọ̀ lo díískì; ààlà ìrántí àti ìṣirò yàtọ̀ láàárín àwọn ẹ̀yà MySQL àti MariaDB."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Connection thread creation"
msgstr "Ìṣẹ̀dá okùn ìsopọ̀"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review connection reuse and thread_cache_size. Check the server thread-handling mode before tuning; thread-pool implementations do not behave like one-thread-per-connection servers."
msgstr "Ṣàtúnyẹ̀wò ìlò-lẹ́ẹ̀kan-síi ìsopọ̀ àti thread_cache_size. Ṣàyẹ̀wò ipò ìtọ́jú okùn olùpèsè kí o tó ṣàtúnṣe; àwọn ìṣe adágún-okùn kì í hùwà bíi àwọn olùpèsè okùn-kan-fún-ìsopọ̀-kọ̀ọ̀kan."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review slow-query logging, long_query_time, and query plans before changing server buffers. This counter depends on the configured slow-query threshold and does not identify individual statements."
msgstr "Ṣàtúnyẹ̀wò àkọsílẹ̀ ìbéèrè tó lọ́ra, long_query_time, àti àwọn ètò ìbéèrè kí o tó yí ààbò olùpèsè padà. Òǹkà yìí da lórí ààlà ìbéèrè tó lọ́ra tí a ṣètò, kò sì dá àwọn gbólóhùn kọ̀ọ̀kan mọ̀."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Slow statements"
msgstr "Àwọn gbólóhùn tó lọ́ra"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Cumulative advice deferred until the observation window is sufficient."
msgstr "Ìmọ̀ràn àkópọ̀ ti sún síwájú títí àkókò àkíyèsí yóò fi tó."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Thread-cache advice is not assessed: thread_handling is unavailable or is not one-thread-per-connection. Review the active thread-pool implementation instead."
msgstr "A kò ṣàyẹ̀wò ìmọ̀ràn ìpamọ́-okùn: thread_handling kò sí tàbí kì í ṣe okùn-kan-fún-ìsopọ̀-kọ̀ọ̀kan. Ṣàtúnyẹ̀wò ìṣe adágún-okùn tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ dípò rẹ̀."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Required counters are missing or invalid: %s, %s. Check server-version support and monitoring permissions."
msgstr "Àwọn òǹkà tí a nílò sọnù tàbí kò tọ́: %s, %s. Ṣàyẹ̀wò àtìlẹ́yìn ẹ̀yà olùpèsè àti àwọn àṣẹ àbójútó."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "A counter reset since the prior sample; collect another representative interval before tuning."
msgstr "Òǹkà kan ti tún bẹ̀rẹ̀ láti àpẹẹrẹ tó kọjá; gba àkókò aṣojú mìíràn kí o tó ṣàtúnṣe."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Insufficient activity: %.0f %s; at least %d observations are needed for this advisory."
msgstr "Ìṣiṣẹ́ kò tó: %.0f %s; ó kéré tán àkíyèsí %d ni a nílò fún ìmọ̀ràn yìí."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Counters are inconsistent or were reset independently. Collect a new representative sample before tuning."
msgstr "Àwọn òǹkà kò báramu tàbí a tún wọn bẹ̀rẹ̀ lọ́tọ̀ọ̀tọ̀. Gba àpẹẹrẹ aṣojú tuntun kí o tó ṣàtúnṣe."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The interval sample is too small or counters reset; collect another representative interval before tuning."
msgstr "Àpẹẹrẹ àkókò náà kéré jù tàbí àwọn òǹkà tún bẹ̀rẹ̀; gba àkókò aṣojú mìíràn kí o tó ṣàtúnṣe."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Interval %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); investigation threshold: %s."
msgstr "Àkókò %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); ààlà ìwádìí: %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cumulative %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); investigation threshold: %s."
msgstr "Àkópọ̀ %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); ààlà ìwádìí: %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "This counter can omit memory-mapped temporary files on MySQL; a low ratio does not rule out disk use."
msgstr "Òǹkà yìí lè fo àwọn fáìlì ìgbà díẹ̀ tí a yà sórí ìrántí kọjá lórí MySQL; ìpín tó kéré kò yọ lílo díískì kúrò."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Redo-log advice deferred until the observation window is sufficient and Innodb_log_waits is available."
msgstr "Ìmọ̀ràn àkọsílẹ̀ àtúnṣe ti sún síwájú títí àkókò àkíyèsí yóò fi tó àti títí Innodb_log_waits yóò fi wà."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cumulative Innodb_log_waits: %.0f."
msgstr "Àkópọ̀ Innodb_log_waits: %.0f."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Investigate transaction sizes, log-buffer pressure, and storage latency. Recheck the rate under load before considering innodb_log_buffer_size; this historical count is not evidence of a current stall."
msgstr "Ṣèwádìí ìwọ̀n ìdúnàádúrà, ìfúngún ààbò àkọsílẹ̀, àti ìfàsẹ́yìn ìpamọ́. Tún òṣùwọ̀n yẹ̀wò lábẹ́ ẹrù iṣẹ́ kí o tó ronú nípa innodb_log_buffer_size; iye ìtàn yìí kì í ṣe ẹ̀rí ìdádúró lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "InnoDB log-buffer waits"
msgstr "Àwọn ìdúró ààbò àkọsílẹ̀ InnoDB"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "installed Cacti composer.json"
msgstr "composer.json Cacti tí a fi sórí ẹ̀rọ"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cacti %s installer requirement"
msgstr "Ìbéèrè olùfisílé Cacti %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "PHP compatibility with installed Cacti"
msgstr "Ìbáramu PHP pẹ̀lú Cacti tí a fi sórí ẹ̀rọ"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; installed Cacti %s."
msgstr "PHP %s tó ń ṣiṣẹ́; Cacti %s tí a fi sórí ẹ̀rọ."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Could not establish Cacti's PHP requirement. Check the installed Cacti composer.json or release documentation; Doctor does not assume compatibility."
msgstr "Kò lè dá ìbéèrè PHP ti Cacti múlẹ̀. Ṣàyẹ̀wò composer.json Cacti tí a fi sórí ẹ̀rọ tàbí ìwé ìtújáde; Doctor kì í gba ìbáramu gbọ́ lásán."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "PHP >= %s and < %s"
msgstr "PHP >= %s àti < %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "PHP >= %s"
msgstr "PHP >= %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Requires %s (%s). Running PHP meets that requirement."
msgstr "Nílò %s (%s). PHP tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ mú ìbéèrè náà ṣẹ."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Requires %s (%s). Running PHP does not meet that requirement."
msgstr "Nílò %s (%s). PHP tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ kò mú ìbéèrè náà ṣẹ."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Detected %s; Doctor requires Cacti 1.2.20 or newer."
msgstr "A ṣàwárí %s; Doctor nílò Cacti 1.2.20 tàbí tuntun jù bẹ́ẹ̀ lọ."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Supported Cacti version"
msgstr "Ẹ̀yà Cacti tí a ṣètìlẹ́yìn fún"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "PHP upstream security support"
msgstr "Àtìlẹ́yìn ààbò òkè-ìpilẹ̀ PHP"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "This checks the PHP release branch, not whether this patch release is up to date or whether your OS vendor backports fixes. Cacti compatibility is checked separately."
msgstr "Èyí ń ṣàyẹ̀wò ẹ̀ka ìtújáde PHP, kì í ṣe bóyá ìtújáde àtúnṣe yìí wà lọ́jọ́ tàbí bóyá olùtajà OS rẹ ń ṣàtúnṣe sílẹ̀. A ń ṣàyẹ̀wò ìbáramu Cacti lọ́tọ̀."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; upstream security-support status is unknown or this is a prerelease. Check https://www.php.net/supported-versions.php and update Doctor's support data."
msgstr "PHP %s tó ń ṣiṣẹ́; ipò àtìlẹ́yìn ààbò òkè-ìpilẹ̀ kò jẹ́ mímọ̀ tàbí èyí jẹ́ ìtújáde ìṣáájú. Ṣàyẹ̀wò https://www.php.net/supported-versions.php kí o sì mú dátà àtìlẹ́yìn Doctor dójúìwọ̀n."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; PHP %s receives upstream security fixes through %s."
msgstr "PHP %s tó ń ṣiṣẹ́; PHP %s ń gba àwọn àtúnṣe ààbò òkè-ìpilẹ̀ títí di %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; PHP %s no longer receives upstream security fixes; support ended %s. Upgrade to a supported PHP branch compatible with your Cacti installation, or confirm security maintenance with your OS vendor."
msgstr "PHP %s tó ń ṣiṣẹ́; PHP %s kò gba àwọn àtúnṣe ààbò òkè-ìpilẹ̀ mọ́; àtìlẹ́yìn parí ní %s. Ṣàgbéga sí ẹ̀ka PHP tí a ṣètìlẹ́yìn fún tó bá ìfisílé Cacti rẹ mu, tàbí rí ìtọ́jú ààbò dájú pẹ̀lú olùtajà OS rẹ."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Required current CLI PHP extensions"
msgstr "Àwọn àfikún PHP CLI lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ tí a nílò"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Required web PHP extensions"
msgstr "Àwọn àfikún PHP wẹ́ẹ̀bù tí a nílò"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Missing: %s. Install them through the operating system package manager."
msgstr "Sọnù: %s. Fi wọ́n sílé nípasẹ̀ olùṣàkóso àkójọ ẹ̀rọ ìṣiṣẹ́."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "All PHP extensions required by the Cacti installer are loaded in this PHP context."
